      "message": "I really should have left a TODO here :) I agree that dist isn\u0027t great here. It misses all of the non-dist builds (llvm, build-tools, etc), and misses the installclean for all the incremental builds.\n\nWe don\u0027t have a great way to check for the buildbots today -- we could make some bad assumptions about our specific environment, (USER \u003d\u003d android-build / TOP ~\u003d ...), but I think this just goes into our wishlist for buildbot improvements.\n\nAnd right now in the buildbots, we only get DIST_DIR set if dist is passed :( , so we can\u0027t proactively set things to the DIST_DIR in those case. Though we could fix the installclean issue by copying all the old logs/traces from OUT_DIR to DIST_DIR when we have it...",
